{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/blizzard-new/abroad/pulls/2","id":4781104031,"node_id":"PR_kwDOU62qx88AAAABHPnbnw","html_url":"https://github.com/blizzard-new/abroad/pull/2","diff_url":"https://github.com/blizzard-new/abroad/pull/2.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/blizzard-new/abroad/pull/2.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/blizzard-new/abroad/issues/2","number":2,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Add TKU exchange data and atomic content governance","user":{"login":"blizzard-new","id":262101326,"node_id":"U_kgDOD59ZTg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/262101326?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/blizzard-new","html_url":"https://github.com/blizzard-new","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blizzard-new/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blizzard-new/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blizzard-new/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blizzard-new/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blizzard-new/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blizzard-new/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blizzard-new/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blizzard-new/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blizzard-new/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"加入淡江大學校級出國交換資料、學生流程及管理工作台。128筆唯一計畫／119所原始合作機構中，4筆屬2027–2028日本組第二梯次、124筆為2026–2027參考資料；未把全部姊妹校當成本期開放名單。本期4校名額合計7，校內申請期限2026-09-30中午（Asia/Taipei）已過，外校後續送件與期限分開標示。重要欄位附官方URL、原文／頁碼、年度及查核日期；152個重要欄位89已核實、63保留缺口／適用矛盾，未核實新版與官方尚未公告分開。4份TKU workflow仍為未發布的partial資料，不製造正式真人核准。\n\n管理流程重用既有檔案／Supabase stores，提供来源／适用修正、snapshot-bound staging、獨立雙人review、destination promotion／rollback及workflow history／release readiness。寫入以完整hash／CAS／單一交易保護；來源修正失效並保留完整舊attestation，精確原envelope重試不重寫資料或audit。\n\n最終補修以實際publication_action、current／restore版本鏈與已落庫獨立approve／公開payload收據驗證發布和回滾。只改operation不能繞過provenance；缺失／NULL／非陣列的revisions或published明確拒絕，避免SQL NULL跳過型別拒絕。service-only合成RPC驗證不代表一般admin API可達。不具完整歷史approve／publish收據的舊版本會拒絕回滾；合法恢復先前已稽核rollback及精確重試通過。原RPC signature、ACL、owner、invoker security及search_path維持相同。\n\n固定驗證commit：`b67d79aa3b6c30a9449801501256b64951f2c291`；基準main：`f6ad1b8cedc4dadb4d00c29eb3456a7a87856d59`。\n\n- 完整本機同CI分片命令：1827個唯一案例，1813 passed／0 failed／14既有skipped；四片實際exit0、來源起訖clean。原093清單1789個案例全部保留，新增38、移除／重複0。測試、原timeout／skip／斷言未修改。\n- 原b8完整結果1804 passed／9 failed／14 skipped及原log/XML獨立保留；相同九案例在固定b67串行重跑9 passed。重跑不覆寫原失敗，也不合成為原b8全綠。\n- 真實隔離治理SQL：10個原治理migrations＋2個原canonical functions、2個實際PostgREST，17組／74次RPC／31筆命令audit通過、cleanup passed。原不可變RPC005原publish與只改operation均409、六表不變；原b8缺published envelope及原六表精確重播400、六表不變。標準發布9個shape否決與rollback21個否決、合法發布／rollback／replay、真正overlap CAS及late-failure atomicity均通過。\n- OpenAPI、strict pip-audit、3份JS syntax、git diff及34 migration解析共7項exit0；解析563 statements／11 SQL bodies／73 PL units。既有31 migration與基準main逐byte相同。\n- CGU／NTPU／NTU官方資料tree與基準main相同。本轮SQL補修相對5d未修改src、tests、TKU官方資料或Actions YAML。\n\n完整34-migration／Storage runtime **尚未驗證**：原固定5d、未改命令的完整重跑在原pinned Supabase17.6.1.136映像register layer階段仍ENOSPC，未到migrations／Storage。只安全清理380,440,118 bytes已逐hash證明可重建的自有build/lib；原錯誤、憑證、唯一證據、其他session及Docker未知image不刪。官方3個pinned映像43層bytes/digest及tar metadata只讀核對，VFS前綴去重模型約38.97GiB；可見root可用約15.22GiB，差約23.75GiB。42GiB可寫空間是含額外空間的規劃目標，非實測daemon quota，需環境維護者先確認掛載／quota。沒有擴容付費、開新環境、換image／driver、增加權限或憑證；subset結果不替代full runtime／Storage，也未驗證新增school-community／byline migration的實際runtime。\n\n共用整合面：registry／API／models／advisor／documents及學生資格與UI；content_governance／governance_commands／routes／destination review／storage／readiness及管理UI；3個新migration依序20261009040000（verified email）、060000（byline）、080000（atomic commands）。TKU資料、爬取／稽核、學院系所與學校adapter均獨立檔案；整合者需合併共用面，不能以此次固定分支測試冒充合併後測試。\n\nQuality（API名`.github/workflows/quality.yml`，YAML名Web quality，ID374368612）於2026-10-09 11:41:04 UTC依使用者批准停用，push前回讀disabled_manually；Deploy to Supabase 374368613仍active，未更動。沒有重試帳務阻塞run、刪歷史artifact／通知、重啟Quality或改部署設定。本session只推候選，保持draft；唯一合併與發布者為父端整合任務01a120b8-5edf-753f-9a61-b4556eaf40b6。\n\n本輪原始log/XML、完整六表before/after、實際exit與固定source guards、migration相容性及SHA256清單保存在原環境`/tmp/tku-governance-b67d79a/`（final-review-summary.json、local-evidence-manifest.json）；磁碟／安全清理／停用／ENOSPC原始證據在`/tmp/tku-governance-runtime-recovery/`。既有遠端純證據分支artifacts/tku-governance-m2仍固定1343abda9d1f2c099947699096e3c86f0e1d42c0，未改写；本輪只推程式碼候選，不新增大型遠端artifact。\n","created_at":"2026-10-08T02:49:53Z","updated_at":"2026-10-09T13:38:25Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"0a72594bf4fba9e57e0caacc653dbc0332a1d8ab","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":true,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/blizzard-new/abroad/pulls/2/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/blizzard-new/abroad/pulls/2/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/blizzard-new/abroad/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/blizzard-new/abroad/issues/2/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/blizzard-new/abroad/statuses/b67d79aa3b6c30a9449801501256b64951f2c291","head":{"label":"blizzard-new:data/tku-exchange-20261008","ref":"data/tku-exchange-20261008","sha":"b67d79aa3b6c30a9449801501256b64951f2c291","user":{"login":"blizzard-new","id":262101326,"node_id":"U_kgDOD59ZTg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/262101326?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/blizzard-new","html_url":"https://github.com/blizzard-new","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blizzard-new/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blizzard-new/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blizzard-new/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blizzard-new/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/